      "content": "i know you're supposed to say that, but it just feels so hollow. it's not just \"stress,\" it's like the actual structure of my life has collapsed. everything i worked for is gone. i look at my desk and i just see a grave for my career. it feels like the only logical way to deal with this much shame is to just... not be here to face it anymore. like, why keep up the act when there's nothing left to show for it?",
